>> Most people probably not really familiar with lircN device. It would be
>> good to provide more information about how to enable this, e.g.,
>>   CONFIG_RC_CORE=y
>>   CONFIG_BPF_RAWIR_EVENT=y
>>   CONFIG_RC_LOOPBACK=y
>>   ......
